9044 0 obj
  << /ActualText (H1 2026 delivered revenue broadly in line with a challenging budget\054 but full\055year profitability was materially below plan once the complete cost base is reflected\056 Revenue reached \2461\054123\0566M\054 51\0565\045 of the confirmed \2462\054180\0569M H1 budget\054 on volume of 840\0564 MT across 41 trades\054 with gross margin of 18\0561\045\056 after \24638\0566M in finance costs\054 the net loss was \24673\0566M\056)
     /K [ 38 ]
     /P 9045 0 R
     /Pg 8968 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

