9046 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The \2461\054057\0563M shortfall against the original revenue budget remains the primary driver of H1 underperformance\056 Management accounts show gross margin essentially on budget \05018\0561\045 actual vs 18\0567\045 budget\051\073 the swing to a \24673\0566M net loss reflects logistics\054 administrative\054 and finance costs that did not scale down with lower trade volumes\054 on top of the revenue shortfall itself\056 The shortfall traces to three root causes\054 all addressable in H2\072 a supply sourcing gap driven by spot\055market procurement and farmer price misalignment\073 operational gaps including 5\045 weight loss and quality and coordination issues\073 and pricing voilatility\056)
     /K [ 39 ]
     /P 9047 0 R
     /Pg 8968 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

