  << /K [ 9422 0 R ]
     /P 9776 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 8968 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

9424 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Hence\054 we propose owning our own fleet\054 outsourcing the mgt of these trucks \056 This will increase our volumes\054 reduce costs and improve our delivery time as well as our cash conversion cycle\056 The goal is to use electric 40ft trucks as opposed to CNG as CNG infrastructure is government dependent and development in core rural regions is not bankable\056)
     /K [ 229 ]
     /P 9425 0 R
     /Pg 8968 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
