9532 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Kasuwa in its current Phase is a demand\055led model\054 where food processors place orders and Kasuwa reaches out through its Fulfillment Centres to fulfil demand\054 alongside the introduction of aggregator\055led fulfilment across operating regions\056 Users also have wallets to receive and send money with other benefits like check prices\054 and available orders\056)
