9536 0 obj
  << /ActualText (H2 will focus on zoning community centres into key states for focus and deeper penetration under Zonal Coordinators\054 consolidating all key Agriarche activities in those areas under a structured leadership\056)
     /K [ 286 ]
     /P 9537 0 R
     /Pg 8968 0 R
     /S /Span
