9538 0 obj
  << /ActualText (H2 features include listings\054 logistics module\054 and agent app\056 The logistics module is to automate all hauling activities on the platform\054 from logistics partner onboarding to fleet management\054 dispatching\054 tracking\054 and payments\056 Currently\054 payment and sourcing of logistics are done manually\054 this module is to enable end\055to\055end order tracking from seller dispatch to buyer receipt\056 The listing side will allow sellers \050farmers \046 Aggregators\051 to list commodities for sale or purchase without waiting for a direct order from buyer\054 thereby creating increased visibility and market accessibility\056 This will drive buyer conversion and increase platform activities\056 The Agent App will allow Field agents to carry out onboarding for farmers\054 aggregators or buyers\054 monitor farms\054 coordinate deliveries especially at the IP side\054 serving as bridge between the platform and the rural communities\056 This will drive numbers and usage level\054 expand the reach of kasuwa\054 while creating impact\056)
     /K [ 287 ]
     /P 9539 0 R
     /Pg 8968 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

9539 0 obj
  << /K [ 9538 0 R ]
     /P 9776 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 8968 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

